{"labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 3, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le02ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le02ob04re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: This coast tour is a great way to see the sites of San Francisco. Which attractions would you like to see?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The Golden Gate Bridge is amazing. I hope we can find a great place to take photographs near the water.", "id": 2, "time": "9000", "image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: You must go on a cable car. They are an icon of San Francisco.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Absolutely,  I really want to see Alcatraz, too.  The island prison is so cool and a little mysterious. Are you allowed inside?", "id": 3, "time": "18000", "image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img03.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: No, it's closed. Did you know that prisoners tried to escape by swimming across the bay?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Did any prisoners make it?", "id": 4, "time": "38000", "image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: Yes, I think so. The famous mobster, Al Capone, spent many years in jail there.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Really? That's neat.", "id": 5, "time": "48000", "image": "engenn4le02ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Aunt Nelly</span>: One of my favorite movies was filmed in that prison, too. Birdman of Alcatraz \u2026 starring Burt Lancaster.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Who's that?", "id": 6, "time": "59000", "im